#
# Wave 4 — the LLM-judge audit (scripts/judge_audit.py) over the Wave 3
# production-parity run. All three are DERIVED from
# release_parity-baseline.jsonl by pure replay (no model call), so they can be
# rebuilt exactly; they are anchored because the switch decision on VERIFY_LLM
# is argued from them. The adjudication file is the only hand-written one: it
# carries a human reading of each machine FABRICATION-PASS and cannot be
# regenerated.
#     venv/bin/python scripts/judge_audit.py data/eval/release_parity-baseline.jsonl \
#       --adjudications data/eval/judge_audit_adjudication_parity-baseline.jsonl \
#       --jsonl data/eval/judge_audit_parity-baseline.jsonl --quiet
4a092e5ba7b737a1625c8b4ba0a66d6652f7a3b93fefd054c95984aafde9b026  data/eval/judge_audit_parity-baseline.jsonl
